<% layout('layouts/main') -%>
<div class="participant-shell"><section class="content-card participant-card"><div class="eyebrow">AKSES PESERTA</div><h1 class="h3 mt-2">Masuk ke Sesi Kuesioner</h1><p class="text-muted">Kode sesi: <b><%= sesi.kode_sesi %></b></p><p>Halo, <b><%= sesi.nama_peserta %></b>. Masukkan PIN 6 digit yang diberikan administrator.</p><% if (error) { %><div class="alert alert-warning"><%= error %></div><% } %><form method="post" action="/kuesioner/akses/<%= token %>"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label class="form-label" for="pin">PIN Sesi</label><input class="form-control form-control-lg pin-input" id="pin" name="pin" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{6}" minlength="6" maxlength="6" autocomplete="one-time-code" required placeholder="••••••"><button class="btn btn-primary w-100 mt-3" type="submit">Verifikasi PIN</button></form><p class="small text-muted mt-4 mb-0">Jangan membagikan PIN kepada orang lain. Percobaan yang gagal dibatasi demi keamanan.</p></section></div>
